         label="Collatz implication atlas (2026-09-24). Boxes: Collatz family (bold) and helpers (dashed); ellipses: famous problems/theorems; hexagons: nodes added 2026-09-24.\nEdges: black PROVED, blue CITED, orange dashed CONDITIONAL, red dotted FALSE (route refuted), grey dashed OPEN (heuristic), light dotted NO KNOWN LINK (barrier). Thick green: highlighted chains. Diamond: AND.", labelloc=b];
